{"body":"This is the new template for full stack blazor. It contains 3 options:\r\n* `--use-server` to add support for server rendered components.\r\n* `--use-wasm` to add support for webassembly rendered components.\r\n* `-pwa` to add support for PWA\r\n\r\nThe template is a single project template and multitargets when you want to use webassembly. The server and webassembly options are hidden until we add support for them.\r\n\r\nAll templates can be seen instantiated with different values (except pwa) [here](https://github.com/javiercn/blazorweb)","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/48285","merge_commit_sha":"426b8b46f9c7cad8b2f0ab502902109ff09be9e6","merged_at":"2023-05-23T08:34:56Z","number":48285,"state":"closed","title":"[Blazor] Add new Blazor Web Template"}
